aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Observing starts by itself as soon as the app opens. Quick setup on the
    first run still ends with the user's Start, after that the app goes
    straight to the sky. Turn it off under Settings if you prefer the button.

