aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows: the sample stream from the SDR tool went through a text-mode
    stdout and every 0x0A byte grew a 0x0D, so the spectrum was garbage.
    The tool now writes to a named pipe. No console windows flash.

 -- Ayushman Tripathi <ayushmantripathi7724@gmail.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0530

aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sky map background is the Gaia all-sky map, bundled, nothing downloaded.
  * Sky map coordinates precessed to J2000.
  * Windows: 64-bit SDR tools (the 0.2.1 zip shipped 32-bit DLLs), HackRF tools included.

